  "prefLabel": "Mec 302.02 Age Requirement",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 302.02 Age Requirement. No individual fuel gas fitting or plumbing license shall be granted to any person less than 18 years of age, and no apprentice license or trainee license shall be granted to any person less than 16 years of age.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.02); ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 302.02) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 300)",
